/T (Engineers Without Borders UIUC is a student-led organization dedicated to applying engineering skills to create lasting, real-world impact. Our current projects include building a bridge in Malawi, designing a sustainable water pipeline in Rwanda, and improving a water sanitation plant in Woodford County, Illinois. Our chapter has been enabling engineering impact for over 20 years, and has helped over 30,000 people across the world, and aims to help another 30,000 by 2027.)
/E (Engineers Without Borders UIUC is a student-led organization dedicated to applying engineering skills to create lasting, real-world impact. Our current projects include building a bridge in Malawi, designing a sustainable water pipeline in Rwanda, and improving a water sanitation plant in Woodford County, Illinois. Our chapter has been enabling engineering impact for over 20 years, and has helped over 30,000 people across the world, and aims to help another 30,000 by 2027.)
